1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,192 --> 00:01:55,816
=Episode 3=

21
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,520
It's Di Liren.

22
00:02:13,001 --> 00:02:14,160
What took you so long?

23
00:02:14,561 --> 00:02:15,320
Because it's you.

24
00:02:15,401 --> 00:02:16,361
I just freshened up.

25
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,001
I still prefer you

26
00:02:21,001 --> 00:02:21,720
without makeup.

27
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,121
I'll take it off now.

28
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,320
So obedient, huh?

29
00:02:24,561 --> 00:02:26,401
I just want to keep you happy.

30
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,880
Two cups of coffee?

31
00:02:36,401 --> 00:02:37,241
It's still warm.

32
00:02:39,961 --> 00:02:40,841
Someone just left?

33
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,081
No.

34
00:02:44,521 --> 00:02:45,640
They're both mine.

35
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,521
I just got a new coffee machine,

36
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:47,961
so I can

37
00:02:47,961 --> 00:02:48,920
make coffee for you.

38
00:02:49,801 --> 00:02:51,440
I made too much

39
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,401
on my first try,

40
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,001
so I poured it all out.

41
00:02:54,961 --> 00:02:55,281
There is

42
00:02:55,281 --> 00:02:56,361
my lipstick on the rim.

43
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:58,281
My bad.

44
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,640
I'll reimburse you for the machine.

45
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,521
That might be a bit tricky,

46
00:03:05,001 --> 00:03:05,920
because it was a gift.

47
00:03:10,401 --> 00:03:11,241
From a man?

48
00:03:12,081 --> 00:03:12,521
What?

49
00:03:13,801 --> 00:03:14,440
Are you jealous?

50
00:03:16,648 --> 00:03:20,072
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

51
00:03:22,152 --> 00:03:25,864
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

52
00:03:26,248 --> 00:03:28,936
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

53
00:03:28,936 --> 00:03:31,752
♪I fall into the abyss♪

54
00:03:38,984 --> 00:03:42,856
♪Shadows torn apart by moonlight♪

55
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:48,328
♪Shards can't piece together tomorrow♪

56
00:03:48,328 --> 00:03:50,952
♪You set gentle traps♪

57
00:03:51,112 --> 00:03:53,800
♪Trapping me in place♪

58
00:04:02,281 --> 00:04:03,001
Honey,

59
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:07,081
my period just started.

60
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,841
It shouldn't be now.

61
00:04:12,801 --> 00:04:13,440
I've been

62
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,640
stressed out from work.

63
00:04:15,241 --> 00:04:16,161
My cycle's messed up.

64
00:04:22,121 --> 00:04:23,080
Get some rest then.

65
00:04:23,121 --> 00:04:23,721
You're leaving?

66
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:24,960
Back to work.

67
00:04:27,361 --> 00:04:28,481
I'll make it up to you,

68
00:04:28,481 --> 00:04:28,840
okay?

69
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:34,241
I'm off.

70
00:04:37,992 --> 00:04:41,640
♪Cigarette glows like an epitaph♪

71
00:04:41,768 --> 00:04:43,880
♪The footnotes you left♪

72
00:04:44,488 --> 00:04:48,328
♪Are all plagiarized♪

73
00:04:55,721 --> 00:04:57,241
Wipe your mouth clean.

74
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:03,624
♪Gaze colder than a blade♪

75
00:05:03,848 --> 00:05:06,440
♪I wipe away my tears♪

76
00:05:06,568 --> 00:05:11,784
♪And switch to a new soul♪

77
00:05:12,456 --> 00:05:14,888
♪I've seen this game before♪

78
00:05:15,176 --> 00:05:17,608
♪Every single move was calculated♪

79
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,280
The CFO, right?

80
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:21,960
Ready to work with me?

81
00:05:23,041 --> 00:05:24,041
Show me your sincerity.

82
00:05:26,216 --> 00:05:28,648
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

83
00:05:28,648 --> 00:05:30,760
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

84
00:05:32,552 --> 00:05:34,184
(Lanxu Hot Spring Hotel)

85
00:05:54,681 --> 00:05:55,121
Hello?

86
00:05:56,241 --> 00:05:57,280
I'm already downstairs.

87
00:06:02,481 --> 00:06:03,161
Honey,

88
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,280
I'm so sorry.

89
00:06:04,801 --> 00:06:05,960
I have a business dinner

90
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:06,561
to go.

91
00:06:07,001 --> 00:06:07,400
I have

92
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,481
ordered dinner for you.

93
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,601
My colleagues said

94
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,880
this restaurant is amazing.

95
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:11,960
Just stay home

96
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,080
and wait for your food.

97
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,561
(Di Liren)

98
00:06:19,561 --> 00:06:20,280
(Enjoy your meal.)

99
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,241
He ordered dinner for you.

100
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:22,880
Is that a way

101
00:06:22,921 --> 00:06:23,921
to check up on you?

102
00:06:24,241 --> 00:06:25,400
If no one signs for it,

103
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,280
won't he get leery?

104
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,001
Right.

105
00:06:30,361 --> 00:06:31,760
Hello, I have a delivery coming.

106
00:06:31,801 --> 00:06:33,161
(Property Management)
Please accept it for me. Thanks.

107
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,520
No rush.

108
00:07:12,121 --> 00:07:13,041
What?

109
00:07:14,241 --> 00:07:15,960
Afraid you can't resist my charm?

110
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,080
Can't hold back?

111
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,121
Aren't you more attracted to me?

112
00:07:22,801 --> 00:07:23,801
Acting tough won't help.

113
00:07:26,001 --> 00:07:26,880
It's soft here.

114
00:07:28,041 --> 00:07:29,280
Let me try it out.

115
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:32,320
What's wrong?

116
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,481
We haven't eaten yet.

117
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,840
We have the whole night.

118
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:37,681
No rush.

119
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,200
Who's rushing?

120
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,561
Let's make an exception tonight

121
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,001
and eat at the restaurant.

122
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,161
No.

123
00:07:47,681 --> 00:07:48,601
Someone might see us.

124
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:50,200
We've only been out

125
00:07:50,241 --> 00:07:51,760
on one date the entire month.

126
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,400
Being cooped up in the room every time,

127
00:07:55,681 --> 00:07:57,481
how is this any different
from being at home?

128
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,801
Didn't I compromise

129
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,140
and take you to the hot springs?

130
00:08:05,561 --> 00:08:06,801
If you want to dine out,

131
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:07,840
fine.

132
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,561
You go,

133
00:08:10,121 --> 00:08:10,721
and I leave.

134
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,400
Fine.

135
00:08:18,921 --> 00:08:19,760
Whatever you say.

136
00:08:21,121 --> 00:08:22,001
You order dinner.

137
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,320
I'm taking a shower.

138
00:08:24,721 --> 00:08:25,760
Or

139
00:08:29,721 --> 00:08:30,801
want to join me?

140
00:08:33,481 --> 00:08:34,121
Sure.

141
00:08:35,321 --> 00:08:36,001
You go ahead.

142
00:08:36,481 --> 00:08:37,241
I'll be there soon.

143
00:08:39,121 --> 00:08:39,880
Come quickly.

144
00:08:54,081 --> 00:08:54,441
(Yu Meng)
Come.

145
00:10:02,841 --> 00:10:03,400
Honey.

146
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:04,961
Listen to me.

147
00:10:04,961 --> 00:10:05,481
Shut up!

148
00:10:05,841 --> 00:10:07,280
Now you listen to me.

149
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:08,640
Put your clothes on.

150
00:10:08,961 --> 00:10:09,841
Go get a divorce now.

151
00:10:10,961 --> 00:10:11,321
I...

152
00:10:30,841 --> 00:10:31,201
Di...

153
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:32,441
Mrs. Di?

154
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:33,520
Why did you come?

155
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,160
Zhang Tao?

156
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:50,520
Why is it you...

157
00:10:53,441 --> 00:10:54,280
Why are you here?

158
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,201
Mr. Di is meeting with clients.

159
00:10:56,441 --> 00:10:57,520
Wen Xiaoxiao and I are

160
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,280
on standby here.

161
00:10:58,961 --> 00:11:00,001
Liren

162
00:11:00,321 --> 00:11:01,280
never came here at all?

163
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:02,800
No.

164
00:11:05,441 --> 00:11:05,961
Liu Zi.

165
00:11:08,241 --> 00:11:09,001
Honey,

166
00:11:09,121 --> 00:11:09,880
why are you here?

167
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:12,920
Honey,

168
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,841
I was going to the hot spring

169
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,640
with Zi

170
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,481
and a few friends.

171
00:11:16,841 --> 00:11:18,241
A friend of mine said she saw you

172
00:11:18,481 --> 00:11:19,560
coming into this room,

173
00:11:19,841 --> 00:11:21,001
so I came over to check.

174
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:23,601
She must have been mistaken.

175
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,640
I was just talking with clients,

176
00:11:25,961 --> 00:11:27,081
all guys.

177
00:11:27,241 --> 00:11:27,920
We just finished.

178
00:11:31,081 --> 00:11:31,880
Then why did you

179
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:33,040
show up here so suddenly?

180
00:11:33,121 --> 00:11:34,520
Mr. Di just finished

181
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,875
and asked me to drive him home.

182
00:11:36,001 --> 00:11:37,201
When I told him you were here,

183
00:11:37,481 --> 00:11:38,441
he came right up.

184
00:11:43,201 --> 00:11:43,841
See?

185
00:11:44,081 --> 00:11:45,081
I told you.

186
00:11:45,321 --> 00:11:46,880
Liren would never fool around.

187
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,721
Yet you insisted on coming up here.

188
00:11:49,001 --> 00:11:50,001
Look how awkward it is.

189
00:11:50,241 --> 00:11:50,841
Yeah.

190
00:11:51,121 --> 00:11:52,640
She described the guy just like you

191
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:53,721
and sounded so sure.

192
00:11:54,201 --> 00:11:55,201
Meng was put on the spot,

193
00:11:55,241 --> 00:11:56,160
so she dragged me here

194
00:11:56,201 --> 00:11:57,160
to prove her wrong

195
00:11:57,201 --> 00:11:57,961
and shut her up.

196
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,601
Your friend

197
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:01,361
made a mistake.

198
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,321
Honey,

199
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:04,601
Zi and I

200
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,880
are going to the hot spring.

201
00:12:06,081 --> 00:12:07,241
If you're done,

202
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,040
go home first.

203
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,520
All right.

204
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,201
I'll have Zhang Tao stay to drive you.

205
00:12:12,441 --> 00:12:12,880
No need.

206
00:12:12,961 --> 00:12:13,640
I drove here.

207
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:14,481
I'll make sure

208
00:12:14,481 --> 00:12:15,361
Meng gets home safely.

209
00:12:16,241 --> 00:12:17,321
Don't worry, honey.

210
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:18,280
Okay.

211
00:12:18,481 --> 00:12:19,400
I trust you.

212
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,081
What happened?

213
00:12:30,081 --> 00:12:30,841
Let's head out.

214
00:12:31,321 --> 00:12:32,481
What exactly happened?

215
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,601
I'm not sure either.

216
00:12:33,841 --> 00:12:34,721
Di Liren definitely

217
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,880
sensed something was off

218
00:12:36,241 --> 00:12:36,986
and pulled

219
00:12:36,986 --> 00:12:37,991
a bait-and-switch on me.

220
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:39,361
How did he know

221
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,160
you were coming?

222
00:12:40,841 --> 00:12:41,961
Did someone tip him off?

223
00:12:43,841 --> 00:12:45,081
He knows this hotel well.

224
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,201
He definitely

225
00:12:46,201 --> 00:12:47,481
got Zhang Tao to keep watch.

226
00:12:49,201 --> 00:12:50,560
Either way, our cover is blown.

227
00:12:51,201 --> 00:12:51,920
From now on,

228
00:12:51,961 --> 00:12:53,040
he'll get more cautious.

229
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:54,520
Gathering evidence

230
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,481
will be even harder.

231
00:12:56,001 --> 00:12:57,121
He's extremely guarded.

232
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:59,201
He only meets me in hotels he knows well

233
00:12:59,361 --> 00:13:00,601
or in my place.

234
00:13:01,241 --> 00:13:01,760
He even

235
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:02,680
checks my phone

236
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:04,160
to rule out any active recordings.

237
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:07,081
How about

238
00:13:08,241 --> 00:13:10,321
we put a hidden camera in my place?

239
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:12,081
That won't work.

240
00:13:12,601 --> 00:13:13,520
My lawyer said

241
00:13:13,841 --> 00:13:14,481
it is

242
00:13:14,481 --> 00:13:15,441
a serious violation

243
00:13:15,481 --> 00:13:16,321
of personal privacy.

244
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,441
That's a legal risk.

245
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:18,920
Besides, evidence like that

246
00:13:19,241 --> 00:13:20,321
might not even

247
00:13:20,481 --> 00:13:21,721
be admissible in court.

248
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,481
It's better not to take the risk.

249
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:25,880
What do we do now?

250
00:13:27,601 --> 00:13:28,800
For now,

251
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,760
we have to keep playing along.

252
00:13:31,321 --> 00:13:32,321
As long as he sees you,

253
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:33,640
we still have a chance.

254
00:13:38,241 --> 00:13:38,880
Wen Xiaoxiao,

255
00:13:39,201 --> 00:13:40,640
if you really had no intention

256
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,241
of taking my place,

257
00:13:43,001 --> 00:13:44,280
why did you send me that photo?

258
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,441
What photo?

259
00:13:46,241 --> 00:13:47,880
On our wedding anniversary,

260
00:13:48,001 --> 00:13:49,081
he sent me a bouquet

261
00:13:49,361 --> 00:13:50,560
with a photo inside.

262
00:13:51,001 --> 00:13:52,601
That's when

263
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,040
I suspected he was cheating.

264
00:13:54,121 --> 00:13:55,040
Didn't you send it?

265
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,160
I really have no idea.

266
00:13:57,721 --> 00:13:59,081
My position is hardly respectable.

267
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,721
If exposed,

268
00:14:01,121 --> 00:14:02,081
it would backfire on me.

269
00:14:03,361 --> 00:14:04,880
Why would I ever send you the photo?

270
00:14:08,601 --> 00:14:10,001
Then there's only one explanation.

271
00:14:11,841 --> 00:14:12,841
Besides me,

272
00:14:14,001 --> 00:14:14,916
there's another lover.

273
00:14:17,481 --> 00:14:18,361
Another lover?

274
00:14:19,201 --> 00:14:19,721
Who is she?

275
00:14:20,001 --> 00:14:20,640
I don't know.

276
00:14:21,961 --> 00:14:23,961
But whoever put the photo in the flowers

277
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,400
wasn't Wen Xiaoxiao.

278
00:14:25,481 --> 00:14:26,081
She said that?

279
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:27,520
Are you sure

280
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,361
she didn't lie?

281
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:29,601
Lying to me now

282
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:30,920
does her no good.

283
00:14:31,241 --> 00:14:32,441
Di Liren

284
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,321
is so busy at work,

285
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:36,121
yet now another side chick pops up?

286
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,920
That punk

287
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:41,400
is juggling this many women.

288
00:14:44,321 --> 00:14:45,160
It seems you still

289
00:14:45,201 --> 00:14:46,160
don't know men well.

290
00:14:46,361 --> 00:14:46,841
No one

291
00:14:46,841 --> 00:14:48,560
cheats just once.

292
00:14:48,841 --> 00:14:50,081
Once a man discovers pi,

293
00:14:50,121 --> 00:14:51,121
he doesn't stop at three.

294
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,841
There's an infinite string

295
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:54,201
of decimal points right after it.

296
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:55,601
Is it done yet?

297
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:57,081
Seriously? You're crying?

298
00:14:57,321 --> 00:14:58,841
I faint at the sight of blood.

299
00:14:59,001 --> 00:14:59,680
All right, done.

300
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,081
I can't believe,

301
00:15:01,121 --> 00:15:01,920
in this case,

302
00:15:01,961 --> 00:15:03,361
you rushed to get a checkup

303
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:05,121
instead of catching him cheating.

304
00:15:05,601 --> 00:15:06,560
Of course.

305
00:15:07,001 --> 00:15:08,280
I fear he might give me an STD.

306
00:15:13,241 --> 00:15:14,481
Let's look at this another way.

307
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,121
Let's say the other woman does exist,

308
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:17,081
but she and Di Liren

309
00:15:17,121 --> 00:15:18,201
aren't hooking up.

310
00:15:19,241 --> 00:15:20,201
I have no clue.

311
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:21,441
Our only lead right now

312
00:15:21,441 --> 00:15:22,280
is the flower shop.

313
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:23,040
Do you know where

314
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:23,760
he ordered the flowers?

315
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,920
Are you going home today?

316
00:15:25,001 --> 00:15:25,520
Going back

317
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,468
to dig up more info.

318
00:15:26,468 --> 00:15:27,120
What if Di Liren

319
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,560
has already noticed something?

320
00:15:30,775 --> 00:15:31,556
(Husband)
Di Liren.

321
00:15:35,001 --> 00:15:35,520
I don't know.

322
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,361
I know nothing.

323
00:15:36,601 --> 00:15:37,880
I don't know where he got them.

324
00:15:37,961 --> 00:15:38,680
All I know now is

325
00:15:38,721 --> 00:15:39,481
that looking at him

326
00:15:39,481 --> 00:15:40,680
makes me sick to my stomach.

327
00:15:43,201 --> 00:15:44,520
I need some quiet time alone.

328
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:14,601
(You suffered a lot)

329
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,721
(just to get pregnant)

330
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:16,841
(with his child.)

331
00:16:16,961 --> 00:16:18,520
(The pills and the injections you took)

332
00:16:18,601 --> 00:16:20,084
(could fill an entire cart.)

333
00:16:20,084 --> 00:16:20,804
(You even gave up)

334
00:16:20,804 --> 00:16:21,880
(your favorite ice cream.)

335
00:16:22,121 --> 00:16:22,880
(Why should you?)

336
00:16:28,201 --> 00:16:29,880
(Today, I totally realize)

337
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,721
(that my feelings for him,)

338
00:16:32,321 --> 00:16:33,201
(just like ice cream,)

339
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,160
(have completely melted away.)

340
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:38,280
(Thinking about
our sugar-coated marriage)

341
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:40,321
(that was laced with arsenic,)

342
00:16:41,321 --> 00:16:43,520
(I only feel pure physical revulsion.)

343
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,201
(Yet I still have to stand it)

344
00:16:47,201 --> 00:16:48,121
(and play along.)

345
00:16:54,961 --> 00:16:56,280
Stylist Number 88,

346
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:57,800
at your service.

347
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,401
Is the temperature okay for you?

348
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:15,280
Honey,

349
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:16,001
do you remember?

350
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:17,921
The year we just got married,

351
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:19,881
you couldn't sleep one night

352
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:21,481
and took me downstairs

353
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,401
to sneak into Dad's wine cabinet.

354
00:17:23,401 --> 00:17:24,170
We stole a bottle.

355
00:17:24,401 --> 00:17:25,760
You said 1988

356
00:17:25,881 --> 00:17:26,641
sounded so lucky.

357
00:17:27,241 --> 00:17:28,161
Who knew

358
00:17:28,721 --> 00:17:30,320
it was his most expensive vintage?

359
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,520
When you sobered up,

360
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:32,360
you were terrified.

361
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,760
I searched everywhere

362
00:17:34,881 --> 00:17:36,401
and paid a fortune for a replacement

363
00:17:36,721 --> 00:17:38,241
from the same vintage and vineyard.

364
00:17:39,481 --> 00:17:40,641
Yet when we put it back,

365
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:41,441
Dad said

366
00:17:41,921 --> 00:17:42,800
he had already known.

367
00:17:46,881 --> 00:17:47,560
I don't remember.

368
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,161
I forgot long ago.

369
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:50,481
You talk too much.

370
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:05,760
Honey,

371
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,441
are you still mad at me?

372
00:18:07,679 --> 00:18:09,624
I told you, it was
just a misunderstanding today.

373
00:18:11,401 --> 00:18:12,161
I promise,

374
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:14,280
when I have a business dinner again,

375
00:18:14,961 --> 00:18:16,241
I'll let you know in advance.

376
00:18:16,401 --> 00:18:16,961
All right?

377
00:18:18,441 --> 00:18:18,901
By the way,

378
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:20,280
why did you

379
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:20,961
show up there?

380
00:18:21,961 --> 00:18:23,520
Liu Zi and I planned it long ago.

381
00:18:23,881 --> 00:18:24,881
I just forgot about it.

382
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,040
The friend who mistook me

383
00:18:28,481 --> 00:18:29,600
was brought by Liu Zi?

384
00:18:30,721 --> 00:18:31,441
She didn't

385
00:18:31,481 --> 00:18:32,360
seem close to you.

386
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:34,961
We're indeed not close.

387
00:18:35,401 --> 00:18:36,080
Her child

388
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,120
is Chestnut's classmate.

389
00:18:41,360 --> 00:18:41,881
Really?

390
00:18:49,961 --> 00:18:50,441
Don't move.

391
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:56,280
There's an eyelash here.

392
00:18:58,800 --> 00:18:59,641
By the way, honey,

393
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,481
Chestnut's class

394
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:02,921
is putting on a performance.

395
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,681
I'll order flowers for her.

396
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,721
I really liked the bouquet from you

397
00:19:06,721 --> 00:19:07,481
at our anniversary.

398
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:08,961
Send me the shop's info.

399
00:19:22,441 --> 00:19:23,218
(Floral Art)
Meng,

400
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,881
here's my loyalty to you.

401
00:19:25,481 --> 00:19:26,201
Floral Art.

402
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:27,441
I went to the flower shop.

403
00:19:27,881 --> 00:19:28,921
The staff said

404
00:19:28,961 --> 00:19:29,800
that on delivery day,

405
00:19:29,881 --> 00:19:31,080
someone added them on WeChat

406
00:19:32,161 --> 00:19:33,360
and demanded a greeting card.

407
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:34,520
That guy

408
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,881
gave the exact order number

409
00:19:35,881 --> 00:19:37,261
and the recipient's phone number,

410
00:19:37,261 --> 00:19:38,561
so they didn't suspect anything.

411
00:19:39,721 --> 00:19:40,800
Who is it?

412
00:19:41,161 --> 00:19:42,040
Nobody knows.

413
00:19:42,641 --> 00:19:44,520
The card was sent via local courier.

414
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:46,641
That person's Moments was private,

415
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:47,921
and the bio didn't

416
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,721
show the gender.

417
00:19:54,481 --> 00:19:55,401
But I managed

418
00:19:55,641 --> 00:19:57,080
to see the courier slip.

419
00:19:58,760 --> 00:19:59,681
The sender's address

420
00:20:00,881 --> 00:20:01,760
is familiar to you.

421
00:20:04,904 --> 00:20:05,881
(Apt 3901, Bldg 3, Yujing Garden)

422
00:20:05,881 --> 00:20:06,481
This is

423
00:20:07,241 --> 00:20:07,961
my place.

424
00:20:10,241 --> 00:20:11,040
Two possibilities.

425
00:20:11,881 --> 00:20:12,241
One,

426
00:20:12,921 --> 00:20:13,481
that guy lives

427
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:14,681
in your residential complex

428
00:20:14,881 --> 00:20:16,120
and watches you every day.

429
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:17,280
Two,

430
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,120
that person deliberately

431
00:20:19,161 --> 00:20:20,280
mailed it from your place,

432
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:22,241
fearing you might trace clues

433
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,201
back to their identity.

434
00:20:24,201 --> 00:20:24,800
No.

435
00:20:25,881 --> 00:20:26,760
This person

436
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:28,161
must be someone close

437
00:20:28,201 --> 00:20:29,021
to Di Liren and me.

438
00:20:30,441 --> 00:20:31,760
Could we be overthinking it?

439
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:34,481
Maybe Chen Chen sent the photo.

440
00:20:35,120 --> 00:20:36,681
She mailed it from your complex

441
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,201
to get herself off the hook.

442
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:39,881
But Chen Chen

443
00:20:39,921 --> 00:20:40,961
has no motive to do that.

444
00:20:41,481 --> 00:20:42,481
I doubt she realized

445
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:43,921
Han Guang wasn't an option,

446
00:20:43,961 --> 00:20:45,040
switched to Di Liren,

447
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:46,481
and sent the photo

448
00:20:46,481 --> 00:20:47,401
to drive a wedge

449
00:20:47,401 --> 00:20:47,881
between us.

450
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,721
And I looked into Han Guang.

451
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:50,721
He built his fortune

452
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:52,040
through his father-in-law.

453
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,840
A man like him is pragmatic

454
00:20:53,961 --> 00:20:54,600
and knows what

455
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:55,481
is best for him.

456
00:20:55,881 --> 00:20:57,280
I'm sure Chen Chen

457
00:20:57,441 --> 00:20:58,881
knows that very well too.

458
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,120
Besides,

459
00:21:01,721 --> 00:21:02,201
even if she

460
00:21:02,241 --> 00:21:03,520
really went after Di Liren,

461
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:04,520
she would've sent

462
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:05,760
pretty solid evidence.

463
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:06,840
Like

464
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:08,560
photos of Mr. Di and me.

465
00:21:10,641 --> 00:21:12,080
So I guess

466
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:13,120
this person

467
00:21:13,520 --> 00:21:14,280
doesn't know

468
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:15,479
your relationship with him.

469
00:21:15,681 --> 00:21:16,481
I thought

470
00:21:16,681 --> 00:21:17,401
this was just

471
00:21:17,441 --> 00:21:18,921
about a woman trying to replace you.

472
00:21:19,481 --> 00:21:20,320
Turns out

473
00:21:20,921 --> 00:21:21,800
it's not that simple.

474
00:21:24,120 --> 00:21:24,840
Wen Xiaoxiao,

475
00:21:25,641 --> 00:21:27,161
you're digging into this so hard.

476
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:28,280
Are you afraid

477
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:29,600
someone is taking your place?

478
00:21:34,161 --> 00:21:35,201
I don't care about that.

479
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,441
To me,

480
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:38,600
if Di Liren is useless,

481
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:39,484
I'll just ditch him.

482
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:40,760
Of course,

483
00:21:41,360 --> 00:21:42,600
I also want to see

484
00:21:42,681 --> 00:21:43,921
what kind of woman

485
00:21:43,921 --> 00:21:44,840
could actually beat me.

486
00:21:47,201 --> 00:21:48,560
I really can't understand

487
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:49,881
how people like you think.

488
00:21:51,040 --> 00:21:51,560
By the way,

489
00:21:52,201 --> 00:21:53,560
is Di Liren still contacting you?

490
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,161
He doesn't reply to my texts,

491
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,320
and at the office,

492
00:21:56,401 --> 00:21:57,201
I can't even get

493
00:21:57,201 --> 00:21:58,080
into his office.

494
00:21:59,080 --> 00:21:59,921
When he sees me,

495
00:22:00,241 --> 00:22:01,641
he treats me like a stranger.

496
00:22:03,881 --> 00:22:05,360
It seems after that close call,

497
00:22:05,681 --> 00:22:06,721
he's become more cautious.

498
00:22:07,681 --> 00:22:08,481
We need to be quick.

499
00:22:26,056 --> 00:22:26,664
(Dear Yu Meng,
the deduction of RMB 135,000)

500
00:22:26,664 --> 00:22:27,432
(for next year's premium
from card 9223 failed)

501
00:22:30,760 --> 00:22:31,944
(Your available credit is insufficient)

502
00:22:31,944 --> 00:22:33,167
(Please verify and try again)

503
00:22:41,448 --> 00:22:43,848
(Di Liren)

504
00:22:45,120 --> 00:22:46,320
Why is my credit card frozen?

505
00:22:47,401 --> 00:22:48,201
I'm sorry, honey.

506
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:50,080
I temporarily suspended

507
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:50,760
your credit card.

508
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:52,161
Anything to buy?

509
00:22:52,641 --> 00:22:53,800
I need to pay for insurance.

510
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:55,040
Why did you

511
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:56,001
freeze my credit card?

512
00:22:56,161 --> 00:22:57,120
Why didn't you tell me?

513
00:22:58,280 --> 00:22:58,760
I thought

514
00:22:58,760 --> 00:22:59,840
our cash would flow soon,

515
00:23:00,641 --> 00:23:02,040
but it took longer than expected.

516
00:23:02,961 --> 00:23:03,800
Cash flow?

517
00:23:05,401 --> 00:23:06,401
What happened?

518
00:23:07,401 --> 00:23:08,401
The company needed funds,

519
00:23:08,441 --> 00:23:09,241
so I put it all in.

520
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:12,760
You used family funds

521
00:23:12,760 --> 00:23:13,721
without even telling me,

522
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:14,201
huh?

523
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:15,441
Honey,

524
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:16,840
don't be mad.

525
00:23:17,001 --> 00:23:17,721
Premium amount?

526
00:23:17,760 --> 00:23:18,520
I'll give you now.

527
00:23:19,201 --> 00:23:19,840
No need.

528
00:23:20,201 --> 00:23:20,760
I have money.

529
00:23:30,420 --> 00:23:30,824
(Jiao Xu)

530
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:31,481
(Where are you?)

531
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:32,681
(We need to talk.)

532
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:37,080
- Stop! Don't run!
- Stop!

533
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:39,360
- Stop!
- Stop right there!

534
00:23:39,401 --> 00:23:40,040
Stop!

535
00:23:40,280 --> 00:23:41,001
Drive!

536
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:41,840
Go!

537
00:23:42,401 --> 00:23:43,800
- Stop!
- Stop! Get out of the car!

538
00:23:44,401 --> 00:23:45,520
- Stop!
- Stop!

539
00:23:47,721 --> 00:23:48,481
What's going on?

540
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:50,201
Why are they chasing you?

541
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:52,840
When you called me,

542
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:54,441
I had just won a divorce case

543
00:23:55,120 --> 00:23:56,360
by a landslide.

544
00:23:56,401 --> 00:23:58,040
The husband was left with nothing.

545
00:23:58,481 --> 00:24:00,080
He was furious

546
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:02,201
and intended to waylay me out there.

547
00:24:04,641 --> 00:24:05,040
Who knew

548
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:06,560
you could sprint so fast

549
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:07,881
in dress shoes?

550
00:24:09,401 --> 00:24:10,441
I usually pair

551
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:12,201
a suit with sneakers for court.

552
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:13,201
Rule of thumb.

553
00:24:13,481 --> 00:24:14,600
With a windbreaker.

554
00:24:14,721 --> 00:24:15,721
If they catch up,

555
00:24:15,840 --> 00:24:17,080
I slip out of my jacket easily.

556
00:24:17,120 --> 00:24:18,201
They can't grab me at all.

557
00:24:19,881 --> 00:24:20,600
Turns out

558
00:24:20,641 --> 00:24:21,881
you're doing a high-risk job.

559
00:24:26,016 --> 00:24:26,921
They're catching up!

560
00:24:26,921 --> 00:24:27,681
Step on it! Go!

561
00:24:28,760 --> 00:24:29,481
Hit the gas!

562
00:24:29,760 --> 00:24:30,641
I'm doing it!

563
00:24:31,401 --> 00:24:32,481
Turn right!

564
00:24:36,840 --> 00:24:37,921
Don't slow down!

565
00:24:38,120 --> 00:24:39,161
Don't you see the car?

566
00:24:39,241 --> 00:24:40,360
What if we hit it?

567
00:24:48,161 --> 00:24:48,600
I'm sorry.

568
00:24:48,641 --> 00:24:49,241
I'm so sorry.

569
00:24:49,681 --> 00:24:50,320
Wait a moment.

570
00:24:56,808 --> 00:24:59,464
(Di Liren)

571
00:25:01,681 --> 00:25:02,840
You need any help?

572
00:25:03,560 --> 00:25:05,241
I'll only charge a small fee.

573
00:25:05,760 --> 00:25:07,161
Seriously? Charging me?

574
00:25:07,560 --> 00:25:08,961
Whose fault do you think it is?

575
00:25:09,481 --> 00:25:10,401
I should have let them

576
00:25:10,401 --> 00:25:10,961
catch you

577
00:25:10,961 --> 00:25:11,721
and beat you up.

578
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:13,280
Hello, sir.

579
00:25:13,681 --> 00:25:14,360
I'm really sorry.

580
00:25:14,681 --> 00:25:15,961
How would you like

581
00:25:16,241 --> 00:25:17,161
to handle this?

582
00:25:17,241 --> 00:25:18,246
It's not serious.

583
00:25:18,246 --> 00:25:19,120
Go through insurance.

584
00:25:19,120 --> 00:25:19,760
I'm in a hurry.

585
00:25:20,721 --> 00:25:21,241
Okay.

586
00:25:21,921 --> 00:25:23,600
What's their number?

587
00:25:24,840 --> 00:25:25,881
You're asking me?

588
00:25:26,401 --> 00:25:26,881
How would I

589
00:25:26,881 --> 00:25:28,001
know your insurer?

590
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:31,921
Don't tell me
you don't have auto insurance.

591
00:25:32,681 --> 00:25:34,280
Of course, I have it.

592
00:25:34,401 --> 00:25:35,040
